# Nothing bearing a national identity number, a student number or an employer
# name belongs in this repository — not in a file, not in a commit, not in a
# filename. These patterns are a backstop, not the control: the control is
# internal/tools/pii_gate.py, which must pass before any push.

# quarantined material, should it ever be placed here by accident
_PRIVATE*/
_OLD_git*/
*CONTAINS_NATIONAL_ID*
*DO_NOT_SHARE*
*DO_NOT_SEND*
pii_secrets.txt

# raw Saudi training certificates and university records — every one of these
# prints an identity number on its face
TVTC_Accredited_*
KAU_Cybersecurity_Diploma_*
documents/education/*Transcript*
jmbEyMk*

# working files
*.zip
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
node_modules/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
